# Add-on for any profile (text to video or Omni): token reduction, FastVideo's training-free mode after antirez's
# h3.c. DiT blocks 4-29 (4-39 during the first 4 of the 8 steps) run on horizontally paired video tokens; each token
# then gets back its own value plus its pair's update. About 30% faster; the video is not the same as without it.
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/max.env --env-file profiles/token-reduction.env up -d t2v
TR_ARGS=--generator.pipeline.experimental.h3_token_reduction.enabled true
